<% content_for :title, "About" %>
<section class="mk-section">
  <div class="prose">
    <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1>Hosting, minus the hassle.</h1>
    <p class="muted">Cordially is a focused tool for hosts: design a digital invitation, send it to your guest list, and keep track of who's coming — without asking guests to sign up for anything.</p>
    <h2 id="privacy">How guest data is handled</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Guests open their invitation through a private link that only works for them. Links are signed, never indexed, and can be revoked.</li>
      <li>Guest contact details are visible only to the event's host and co-hosts with guest-list access — never to door staff — and are filtered out of our logs.</li>
      <li>Public share links show the invitation without anyone's personal details.</li>
      <li>Guests can stop emails about an event at any time. Deleting an event deletes its guest list and responses.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
